    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Close coordination between stakeholders will be necessary during these reviews to ensure that all needs are met and that The project is on track." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client's to provide change-management support and training, ensuring a smooth transition and effective use of our solution.  we have confirmed availability to onboard an engagement of this size within the proposed timeline, including the constraint of a pilot before a closing campaign, and we are committed to delivering high-quality results while meeting all the client's requirements and constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability during business hours, resilience to seasonal peak loads, integration with accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment, and user directory (SSO)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also be hosted on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these performance and integration requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What modifications or upgrades would be necessary to ensure seamless integration with The client existing systems? our platform Atelier is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can handle common queries with a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds, which should meet The client response time expectations.  our also have high availability during business hours and resilience to peak loads, thanks to our active-active setup across two availability zones and the ability to scale horizontally." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with The client requirements for high availability and resilience." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of integration, our have connectors and adapters for accounting-production software, payroll software, document-management systems (GED), and electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environments through our partnership with Ligeo Conseil. our also support API-first design with REST and webhooks, which can facilitate integration with the client's existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For user directory integration, our support SSO via SAML and OIDC, as well as user directories like LDAP and Entra ID, which should cover the client's single sign-on requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding hosting, our Sovereign tier is hosted on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified. hosted means our can meet the client's requirement for hosting on secure, qualified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

